  <p>
    You retain all rights to the files you upload and the outputs generated by our tools. We claim
    no ownership over your content.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
  <p>
    THE SERVICE IS PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED. WE DO
    NOT WARRANT THAT:
  </p>
  <ul>
    <li>The Service will be uninterrupted, error-free, or secure.</li>
    <li>The results obtained from using any tool will be accurate or reliable.</li>
    <li>Any defects in the Service will be corrected.</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    Tool outputs (such as file conversions, data transformations, and network diagnostic results)
    are provided for informational purposes and should be verified independently when accuracy is
    critical. We are not liable for any decisions made based on tool outputs.
  </p>

  <h2>5. Limitation of Liability</h2>
  <p>
    To the fullest extent permitted by law, Tool-TL shall not be liable for any indirect,
