  <p>
    Files uploaded for processing are used solely to perform the requested operation and are
    automatically deleted within one hour. We do not access, review, or store file contents beyond
    what is technically necessary. For tools that operate entirely in your browser (client-side tools),
    your data never leaves your device.
  </p>

