  <p>
    The Service may contain links to third-party websites or integrate with third-party services
    (such as Google Analytics and Google AdSense). We are not responsible for the content, privacy
    practices, or terms of these third-party services.
  </p>

  <h2>8. Changes to Terms</h2>
  <p>
    We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective immediately
    upon posting to this page. Your continued use of the Service after changes are posted constitutes
